<title>PORTUGAL: Avge yld 5.170 pct on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Avge yld 5.170 pct on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management's auction of 15 billion escudos of three-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:23/3/2000</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED: 6.475 billion escudos  COUPON: 5.375 pct</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.169884 pct</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 5.18  LOWEST: 5.12</p>
<p>BIDS: 47.626 billion escudos PAYMENT FREQUENCY:Annual</p>
<p>PAYMENT DATE: 21/7/97.  </p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 184.01 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
